# 12. Personalization Engine

The Personalization Engine combines:

```text
USER PROFILE
+
FOOD INFORMATION
+
INGREDIENT KNOWLEDGE
+
NUTRITION INFORMATION
+
CONDITION / DIETARY RULES
```

It determines which findings are relevant to the individual user.

The same food should be capable of producing different results for different profiles.

