# 21. LLM Safety Architecture

The system should follow this separation:

```text
                 USER / FOOD INPUT
                         │
                         ▼
                 AI / OCR / NLP
                         │
                         ▼
              STRUCTURED FOOD DATA
                         │
                         ▼
              PERSONALIZED RULE ENGINE
                         │
                         ▼
                 STRUCTURED FINDINGS
                         │
                         ▼
                    LLM LAYER
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              ▼                     ▼
        Explanation             Chatbot
              │                     │
              └──────────┬──────────┘
                         ▼
                     USER OUTPUT
```

### Critical Rule

The LLM must not:

- Independently classify a food as medically safe
- Override the structured risk engine
- Invent nutrition values
- Invent ingredients
- Invent allergen presence
- Diagnose a condition
- Prescribe treatment
- Present uncertain information as certain

When information is insufficient, the system should say so.

