# 30. Responsible Medical / Dietary Positioning

NutriShield is a decision-support and educational system.

It should NOT claim to:

- Diagnose disease
- Treat disease
- Replace a doctor or dietitian
- Guarantee a food is safe
- Guarantee a food will cause harm
- Provide individualized medical prescriptions

Preferred language:

- "may be relevant"
- "consider"
- "caution"
- "verify"
- "based on the information available"
- "your declared profile"
- "no relevant conflict detected"

Avoid unsupported absolute statements.

