# 34. Demonstration Flow

Recommended live demonstration:

```text
1. Create user profile
        ↓
2. Select Diabetes + Hypertension + Peanut Allergy
        ↓
3. Select "Sugar-Free Biscuit"
        ↓
4. Analyze ingredients + nutrition
        ↓
5. Show personalized risk
        ↓
6. Show why it was flagged
        ↓
7. Show confidence and evidence
        ↓
8. Ask AI:
   "Why is this flagged if it is sugar-free?"
        ↓
9. LLM explains the structured findings
        ↓
10. Change user profile
        ↓
11. Analyze the same food again
        ↓
12. Demonstrate:
    SAME FOOD ≠ SAME RISK
```

This demonstrates the central differentiator in a short, understandable flow.

