# 35. Core Product Statement

> **NutriShield does not tell everyone what food is good or bad. It translates the information already present in food labels, menus, and nutrition data according to the individual's circumstances, then explains why certain ingredients or nutrients may matter to that person.**

---

# 36. Final Architecture Principle

The system should maintain a clear separation between:

```text
AI / OCR / NLP
       ↓
INTERPRET FOOD INFORMATION
       ↓
KNOWLEDGE BASE
       ↓
PERSONALIZED RULE ENGINE
       ↓
DETERMINE STRUCTURED FINDINGS
       ↓
LLM
       ↓
EXPLAIN + CONVERSE
       ↓
USER
```

This separation makes NutriShield:

- Personalized
- Explainable
- Transparent
- Extensible
- Demonstrable
- Responsible
- Suitable for a clinical decision-support prototype without presenting itself as a medical diagnostic system
